    <node id="The Parrot">
      <data key="d0">The Parrot</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">The Parrot is a colorful bird with a distinctive appearance, mentioned by Scrooge as he reminisces about the past.&lt;SEP&gt;The Parrot is a talking parrot that Scrooge sees, described as having a green body and yellow tail with a lettuce-like growth on its head.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5ac48fca8de324fa3a899664c908f275&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-947e3553c13534c9202f0f1a5c3291f5</data>
