    <node id="The Spirit">
      <data key="d0">The Spirit</data>
      <data key="d1">spirit</data>
      <data key="d2">The Spirit is a supernatural entity that appears to Scrooge, guiding him through various locations and events from his past.&lt;SEP&gt;The Spirit is an otherworldly being that appears and interacts with Scrooge during Christmas.&lt;SEP&gt;The Spirit is likely a reference to the Ghost of Christmas Present, guiding Scrooge through his past experiences.&lt;SEP&gt;The Spirit is an entity that appears to Scrooge, initially surprising him.&lt;SEP&gt;The Spirit is a supernatural entity that appears to Scrooge and shows him visions of Christmas celebrations past, present, and future.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c5511814d290f9a323b57f387ab26016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f51bc63fe53e1fcc658c81b82799224&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7be9f3c52d8e7cc843fc5a8fc1fcde5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1da5b23e63d82bfc144eaf153cc2718c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c674d9c25459e7bd63e6fccaa06787d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5bce1dbca69786b19a911da5c9794edf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-947e3553c13534c9202f0f1a5c3291f5</data>
