      <data key="d0">Poor Boy</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Poor Boy, likely a reference to Scrooge's former self, experiences various supernatural events and emotions during Christmas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-947e3553c13534c9202f0f1a5c3291f5</data>
