      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Gentlemen of the free-and-easy sort are a group characterized by their adventurous spirit and acquaintance with various activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Gentlemen of the free-and-easy sort are a social group mentioned in the story.</data>
