    <node id="The Bell">
      <data key="d0">The Bell</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">The Bell is an object that Scrooge mentions as being located in the cupola on top of the roof of The Mansion when he and The Spirit visit it.&lt;SEP&gt;The bell is a physical object used for signaling time, striking One when it reaches that hour.&lt;SEP&gt;The bell is mentioned as a clock striking one.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cf42c25cc5f1283160fc9b776e791663&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1da5b23e63d82bfc144eaf153cc2718c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c674d9c25459e7bd63e6fccaa06787d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d760b046fe0d20786a011f0ebb14869a</data>
