    <node id="Christmas">
      <data key="d0">Christmas</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Christmas is a time for celebration, gift-giving, and spending time with loved ones.&lt;SEP&gt;Christmas is a holiday celebrated by the characters, where people come together and exchange gifts.&lt;SEP&gt;Christmas is a holiday season emphasized throughout the story as a time for generosity and kindness.&lt;SEP&gt;The Christmas season serves as a backdrop for the story, with the Ghost's visit occurring on multiple Christmases.&lt;SEP&gt;The holiday mentioned in the context of old Fezziwig's party.&lt;SEP&gt;Christmas is a significant holiday for families to come together and share joyous moments.&lt;SEP&gt;Christmas is a holiday celebrated on December 25th, marked by gift-giving, feasting, and merriment.</data>
