    <node id="Scrooge">
      <data key="d0">Scrooge</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Ebenezer Scrooge, the protagonist of the story, is a miserly businessman who disdains human sympathy and warns others to keep their distance. He is resolute and reluctant to celebrate Christmas, valuing darkness and solitude over festive gatherings. Throughout the narrative, Scrooge experiences various supernatural events, including visions from the Ghost of Christmas Past, interactions with the Spirits, and multiple conversations with other entities.

Scrooge undergoes significant emotional changes throughout these encounters, particularly when observing scenes between characters through the Ghost's visions. His solitary nature is contrasted with his eventual openness to change, as he begins to understand the value of human connections and relationships. As a central character in the story, Scrooge's development serves as a catalyst for the plot's progression.

It is worth noting that while some descriptions emphasize Scrooge's miserly tendencies, others highlight his capacity for emotional growth and transformation. These conflicting portrayals underscore the complexity of the character, allowing readers to form their own opinions about his personality and motivations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4c3317ee16a42d76a396e3f4a9b4d2c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5511814d290f9a323b57f387ab26016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea0dd54b1efa58e8a89cfc1597a7aef2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9815eafa59fa78a659aa70c67cf7c1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f14044ab5836af865c1e895c3e69f02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5eeebd4a7c0b1417f8eb4d15431f546d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d969c1effbc532802f0b8761578160c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2a7ef72626bbee05c0fd8527f6e1957&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd60fc7b4e7ca620749fb6aa21bdd203&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3799fa52e3328bc1c36d79959b1dcd43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e3149dc8749fa588b90d4cc951a60c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f51bc63fe53e1fcc658c81b82799224&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1396694e41876e83b97376904aee5073&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7be9f3c52d8e7cc843fc5a8fc1fcde5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e29ea8f357f27ad14a88f63180d40f54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8744a39345dd8d5c2e23dc4c5974d90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f23cdc0437de25e1da716dae6d61359b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-118ca942f4f3c9502142773f3fdd20d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b41dfad87dfe634e71ee3f31d59a961&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2de884d646c1a1ff4ee591476128511&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d515d836ef3c169d415fdd151180e25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9734fe4802f9c8f1d9eb812bf4e03f69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03812eebf2e60674df0ce729f4351360&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2578f4b9b71e769737a8de262e6b8a26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f600f0ca86e6d9a0ea0ccce27215b2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf42c25cc5f1283160fc9b776e791663&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b8276083af810245d6150ef51adb0c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b1f20d45706bc18474add4f6ec6ab5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e94484b863b810b1e8286991a90c2ed8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c7ac3dd1cede50b9f8bee3617307b61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1da5b23e63d82bfc144eaf153cc2718c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c674d9c25459e7bd63e6fccaa06787d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b911cdfe93e0db0d1dd79be01ad7f80e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-674266fcc96dc2c80a6642653574a251&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ac48fca8de324fa3a899664c908f275&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69ed859ed0032efc424963bc138ba9c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffd1a7ae5fb09fc2adae0d7ed19d8e16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93f6d9efb0c2ed38e91ed03b755dbc00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b7e4f1701e68dab980cffe646b2ca81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-947e3553c13534c9202f0f1a5c3291f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18e346c8b89da