      <data key="d0">Ghost of Christmas Past</data>
      <data key="d1">spirit</data>
      <data key="d2">The Ghost of Christmas Past is a spectral figure who takes Scrooge on a journey through his past, highlighting moments that have contributed to his current state.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ghost of Christmas Past is one of the supernatural beings that visit Scrooge during the night.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ghost of Christmas Past is a supernatural entity guiding Scrooge through his past experiences.</data>
