    <node id="Marley's Ghost">
      <data key="d0">Marley's Ghost</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Marley's Ghost is a pivotal scene in Charles Dickens' novel A Christmas Carol, where Ebenezer Scrooge encounters the spirit of his deceased business partner Jacob Marley.&lt;SEP&gt;Marley's Ghost is the supernatural entity that visits Scrooge to warn him about his own mortality.&lt;SEP&gt;Marley's Ghost is a supernatural entity that haunts Scrooge to make amends for his past wrongdoings.&lt;SEP&gt;Marley's Ghost is an unearthly visitor who torments Ebenezer Scrooge with unclear messages.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ea0dd54b1efa58e8a89cfc1597a7aef2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8744a39345dd8d5c2e23dc4c5974d90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d760b046fe0d20786a011f0ebb14869a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-674266fcc96dc2c80a6642653574a251&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a76055a2c7afe2fed010f2b31fbb8c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bb3d54efe1e83cfa271d9e8c890a144&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf42c25cc5f1283160fc9b776e791663&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c7ac3dd1cede50b9f8bee3617307b61</data>
