    <node id="Jacob Marley">
      <data key="d0">Jacob Marley</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Jacob Marley was an excellent man of business who died, and his name remains on the warehouse door as "Scrooge and Marley."&lt;SEP&gt;Jacob Marley was Ebenezer Scrooge's deceased business partner and friend.&lt;SEP&gt;Jacob Marley is Scrooge's deceased business partner who appears as a ghost.&lt;SEP&gt;The deceased partner of Ebenezer Scrooge's business, who returns as the Ghost to warn Scrooge about his life.&lt;SEP&gt;Jacob Marley was Scrooge's business partner who died and was condemned to wander the earth wearing heavy chains as punishment for his life of greed.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e9815eafa59fa78a659aa70c67cf7c1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1666cdaa6def1f3d74b7b2c92f73aabd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e3149dc8749fa588b90d4cc951a60c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7be9f3c52d8e7cc843fc5a8fc1fcde5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fd7ea7800427decdc6ca6423c069cd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b41dfad87dfe634e71ee3f31d59a961&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf42c25cc5f1283160fc9b776e791663&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a76055a2c7afe2fed010f2b31fbb8c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bb3d54efe1e83cfa271d9e8c890a144</data>
